<title>USA: Carolina First Sept 30 Q3 diluted shr up.</title>
<headline>Carolina First Sept 30 Q3 diluted shr up.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted     $0.33		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net		 3,100		    2,500</p>
